      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing TTS Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. I'm aiming to make this selection clear and prominent within the `synthesize_ssml.py` script. The goal is to ensure the code readily identifies its dependency on this specific TTS provider.\n\n\n**Defining Script Elements**\n\nI'm now focused on the concrete implementation within `synthesize_ssml.py`. My primary objective is a clear connection to the TTS provider. I'm prioritizing the inclusion of provider-specific imports and identifiers, like `google.cloud.texttospeech` and the specific enums. This should make the dependency explicit.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863010104,
          "start": 1789863007633
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc261591001vxeRGvqhpYpiva",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc261139001bYOXrXv1YvwgbA",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d9eedaffeLZRTPzgLr5Ecw5",
